  "question": {
    "text": "A current of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>200</mn><mo> </mo><mi>μA</mi></math> deflects the coil of a moving coil galvanometer through <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>60</mn><mo>°</mo></math>. The current to cause deflection through <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>10</mn></mfrac></math> radian is",
    "image": null
  },
